meta {
  name: Payment Links E2E 10 - Create Link Fails Closed 503
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

post {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/agency/invoices/{{plInvAId}}/payment-link
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "amount": 40000,
    "description": "September retainer — part 1"
  }
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 503
}

docs {
  §54/§111 — the local E2E environment deliberately carries NO Razorpay API
  pair (only the test-only webhook secret), so a VALID request fails CLOSED:
  503, and no link row is stored (§33 — the gateway must accept before the
  store records). The full happy loop with a mocked gateway is proven in
  vitest (agency-payment-link-loop.test.ts, §57).
}
